Z||000004||Ironhorse||07-15-2000||10:05 PM||||I'm not so scare anymore.  I finally found out along with the map sensor, the TPS is at fault, I replaced the TPS that I had and ti does not idle at 3000 4000 rpm anymore.  This time it Idle at 1000 rpm and die after 5 or 6 sec.  I did not replace the map yet cuz I'm broke still.  I'm praying that that's all I need to replace it.  I'm prolly gonna have to replace IAC sensor as well but I'm going to change map first before doing anything else.||||reg||1
